@startuml
title 3번 슬라이드. 서비스 코드는 annotation으로 의도만 표현한다

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  FontColor #0F172A
  RoundCorner 18
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF7ED
  BorderColor #FDBA74
  FontColor #7C2D12
}

top to bottom direction

package "메서드 단위로 WRITE 강제" #EFF6FF {
  rectangle "ParticipationQueryService\n기본: @Transactional(readOnly = true)" as ParticipationQueryService #DBEAFE
  rectangle "findByUserId(), findByCampaignId()\n@UseWriteDataSource" as ParticipationMethod #FEF3C7
  rectangle "FundingParticipationRepository" as ParticipationRepo #F8FAFC

  ParticipationQueryService --> ParticipationMethod
  ParticipationMethod --> ParticipationRepo
}

package "클래스 단위로 WRITE 강제" #F0FDF4 {
  rectangle "InternalCampaignQueryService\n@UseWriteDataSource" as InternalCampaignQueryService #DBEAFE
  rectangle "FundingCampaignRepository" as CampaignRepo #F8FAFC

  InternalCampaignQueryService --> CampaignRepo
}

rectangle "UseWriteDataSourceAspect\nannotation 해석" as Aspect #FDE68A
rectangle "TransactionRoutingDataSource\n최종 WRITE 선택" as Routing #FEF3C7

ParticipationMethod --> Aspect
InternalCampaignQueryService --> Aspect
ParticipationRepo --> Routing
CampaignRepo --> Routing

note bottom of ParticipationQueryService
기본은 readOnly 조회 서비스지만,
일부 메서드만 예외적으로
writer DB를 사용한다.
end note

note bottom of InternalCampaignQueryService
클래스 레벨에 붙이면
그 서비스의 조회 전체가
writer DB를 사용한다.
end note

note bottom of Aspect
서비스는 annotation으로 의도만 표현하고,
실제 전환은 공통 인프라가 처리한다.
end note

@enduml
